{
  "_comment": "Near monochrome with a steel blue cast. Look mean saturation 0.07 on both test frames. Halation off: a red glow is the one colour this look does not have. Grain off for a measured reason: the overlay blend moves channels either side of 0.5 in opposite directions, so a monochrome grain plate still injects chroma, and it took the rendered frame from 0.07 saturation to 0.11.",
